DESCRIPTION:Nothing beats a cozy evening at The Sea Ranch Lodge\, especial
 ly when it supports a great cause.\n\nJoin us for a special Locals Night D
 ine & Donate! Enjoy seasonal dishes\, a glass of wine or two\, and those s
 unset views we never get tired of\, all while giving back to The Kids Club
 .\n\n50% of the evening’s proceeds will support our scholarship program 
 for Kids Club Summer Sessions\, so simply purchasing your ticket counts as
