BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Exclusive Performance by Ray Chen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260429T200000
UID:260420Oe8XilY1wk-yprNODsJw1w
DESCRIPTION:An evening of charisma and virtuosity\, Ray Chen brings his si
 gnature brilliance and expressive range to a program spanning iconic compo
 sers from the Classical era to the Romantic stage.\n\nMoving seamlessly fr
 om elegance to electrifying showmanship\, Ray plays with both lyrical dept
 h and dazzling technical flair. Pianist Chelsea Wang will be accompanying 
 this dynamic performance.\n\nJoin us for an intimate evening which offers 
 a special preview from their upcoming tour across Asia.\n\nGuests are invi
 ted to a post-performance wine social on the terrace\, where they may meet
  the musicians while savoring their favorite Bouchaine wines alongside a s
 election of refined\, chef-prepared heavy appetizers.
LOCATION:Bouchaine Vineyards
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/exclusive-performance-b
 y-ray-chen/18628223/2026-04-29T18
