UID:260425mnpijen_fUOI_CYEZ5FWjg
DESCRIPTION:Healdsburg Community Nursery School celebrates its 60th annive
 rsary of serving little learners with an on-site Makers Market and an onli
 ne auction\, on Friday\, May 1. There is no admission fee\, and families o
 f all ages are invited to visit the school\, participate in interactive le
 arning activities\, enjoy food and beverages\, and purchase items from the
  upscale Makers Market. All vendors will donate a portion of their proceed
 s to the school.\n\nThose who cannot come to the party may register online
  to participate in the school's online auction\, which begins May 1 and cu
 lminates on May 3. Registration is free\, and information provided is secu
 re and will be used for auction purposes only. Prizes include vacations\, 
 dining\, wine-tasting tours\, rock-climbing experiences and more.\n\nVisit
  the school's website\, www.hcnskids.com\, to register for the auction or 
 for more information. The school is located at 444 First St. between Rec P
 ark and Healdsburg Elementary School. Makers Market hours are 4:30 to 7:30
  p.m. Call \\(707\\) 433-1817 for more details.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Community Nursery School
URL:http://www.hcnskids.com
