BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ReNewAll Spring Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260501T150000
UID:251216xnTbPPg0Ikmv0FADzCtqZA
DESCRIPTION:ReNewAll Spring Retreat | May 1-3\, 2026 Join movement educato
 rs Lila Heller and Cary Berkley for a rejuvenating weekend at Mandala Spri
 ngs in beautiful Cobb\, California. Surrounded by nature's serenity\, this
  retreat invites you to reconnect\, restore\, and remember what makes you 
 feel alive. Through guided movement\, mindful connection\, and moments of 
 stillness\, you'll nourish your body\, quiet your mind\, and awaken your s
 enses. Step away from the everyday and step into renewal this spring. The 
 Experience Spring is a time of renewal-a natural invitation to let go of w
 hat's heavy and welcome what's ready to bloom. Through movement\, stillnes
 s\, community\, and nature\, you'll be guided back to your natural rhythm 
 and vitality. You can expect: Daily movement and breathwork sessions to re
 connect to your body A morning hike through the beautiful Mandala Springs 
 grounds A deeply restorative sound bath led by Cary Delicious\, nourishing
  meals Spacious time to rest\, journal\, or explore Evenings of connection
 \, music\, and shared stories around the fire All levels are welcome. Come
  as you are-curious\, tired\, inspired\, or simply ready to breathe a litt
 le deeper.
LOCATION:Mandala Springs
URL:https://www.mandala.org/upcoming-events/2026/5/1/renewall-spring-retre
 at
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
