 of incredible animals including tarantulas\, amphibians\, snakes\, chamele
 ons\, geckos\, monitors\, bearded dragons\, jumping spiders\, tortoises\, 
 turtles\, and much more. Whether you're a seasoned keeper\, a collector\, 
 or just curious about the reptile world\, there is something for everyone.
  Browse vendor booths offering a wide variety of bioactive supplies\, feed
 ers\, plants\, tanks and enclosures\, cork bark\, grapevine\, dry goods\, 
 and reptile care products. Take advantage of exclusive expo-only deals whi
 le finding everything you need to create the perfect habitat for your anim
 als. The expo will also feature live animal shows\, including appearances 
 by amazing animals such as the Patagonian cavy mara and North American opo
 ssum\, alligator & more! Guests can also enjoy a hands-on terrarium buildi
 ng workshop. Watch and learn how to build a bioactive enclosure\, or upgra
 de your experience and build your own terrarium to take home — perfect f
 or your new pet. Bring the whole family and experience one of Northern Cal
 ifornia’s most exciting reptile and exotic animal events. Sonoma County 
 Event Center at the Fairgrounds 1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
  95404 Sat. 10AM-5PM Sun. 10AM-4PM Two-day passes and Family discounts pac
 ks also available online. Get tickets\, directions\, more info at https://
 www.CVRExpo.com
LOCATION:Sonoma County Fair & Event Center
