 merston Estate. This exclusive afternoon invites you to immerse yourself i
 n the heart of our Estate with guided vineyard experiences\, hands-on cust
 om wine blending\, and generous tastings of our premium\, Estate-grown win
 es.\n\nSavor thoughtfully crafted culinary offerings\, enjoy live music se
 t against the backdrop of the property\, and take part in interactive expe
 riences designed to bring our terroir to life. Meet the team\, explore the
