DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T120000
UID:260401ryhfbUhUl0epd35fkq6cKw
DESCRIPTION:Guided tours of the garden and food bank available by request.
  \n\nSupport a great cause while celebrating the joy of gardening! This 
 annual plant sale fundraiser is hosted by Food For Thought food bank\
 , helping provide healthy food and compassionate support to those in n
 eed. Explore the thriving Food For Thought garden\, get inspired by wha
 t’s growing for the food bank\, and shop a variety of veggie\, herb
 \, and flower starts to bring home—lovingly grown by Food For Thou
 ght volunteers and community partners. Every purchase helps feed our ne
 ighbors in need. \n\nSince 1988\, Food for Thought has provided life-sus
 taining groceries\, meals\, and loving support to people living with seri
 ous medical conditions in Sonoma County—all free of charge. \n\nFor mor
 e information\, visit fftfoodbank.org/plant-sale
