BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Explore the Art of Flower Printing at h2hotel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T160000
UID:260425lrojCTKIxE60CdlKVU5CGQ
DESCRIPTION:Led by Lisa Rogers\, owner of SlowDigz\, h2hotel’s Flower
  Printing Workshop will introduce participants to the art of flower print
 ing on silk\, using dried and pressed dye flowers to create a one-of-a-kin
 d neckerchief or bandana. \n\nDuring the two-hour session\, attendees wil
 l explore Tataki Zome\, the technique of hammering fresh botanicals onto 
 fabric\, and the fundamentals of mordanting and scouring\, essential techn
 iques for those interested in further exploring natural dyes. Guests will 
 also enjoy a selection of wines and light bites\, making this an ideal a
 fternoon of artistic exploration and relaxation. \n\nThe event includes a
 ll necessary materials\, personal instruction by Lisa Rogers\, and wine an
 d light bites.
LOCATION:h2hotel’s Green Room
URL:https://h2hotel.com/experiences/?id=5&venue=h2
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
