  Members and guests. Set in the lush outdoor gardens of Elizabeth Spencer 
 winery\, this exclusive event blends the beauty of spring with the creativ
 ity of wine-inspired cocktails\, fabulous wines by the glass\, and the cha
 rm of a local artisanal market.\n\nSip and stroll through the artisanal ma
 rket with glass in hand\, enjoy the ambiance\, connect with local craftsme
