DESCRIPTION:Join us for the first annual Sonoma County Balloon Chase 5k an
 d Little Chasers 1k dash! Presented to you by the Sonoma County Hot Air Ba
 lloon Classic.\n\nThis event will take place on Sunday May 3rd at 8am at K
 eiser Park in Windsor\, California!\n\nThe course is a 3.1 mile road route
  looping around the gorgeous Starr Road and Windsor River Road areas in Wi
 ndsor. Starting and ending in Keiser park. Strollers allowed. Please leave
  dogs at home. \n\n5k entrants receive a hat and collectible pin\n\n1k en
 trants receive a collectible pin with option to add a hat with additional 
 fee.\n\n All participant entry includes the opportunity to take photograp
 hs with local hot air balloons\, learn about what it takes to fly (and cha
 se!) hot air balloons\n\nParking Included with price of registration.  Pa
 cket pickup will be available Saturday May 2nd at Sports Basement in Santa
  Rosa as well as on race morning.
LOCATION:700 Windsor River Road 
URL:https://runsignup.com/Race/CA/Windsor/SonomaCountyHotAirBalloonChase5k
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
