 nan Center\, featuring internationally acclaimed pianist Larry Vuckovich a
 nd legendary jazz vocalist Jackie Ryan. Together for 30 years\, they deliv
 er a dynamic blend of bebop\, blues\, gospel\, Latin classics\, and world 
 music\, showcasing unmatched versatility. The ensemble also includes multi
