BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Crafted Conversations: Alan Cohen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T200000
UID:260425NlMIozWykUGOJsZ3DUVURw
DESCRIPTION:Step into the creative world of Alan B. Cohen\, a Healdsburg-b
 ased architect whose artistic practice transforms driftwood\, junk and
  found coastal materials into striking sculptural works.\n\nJoin us for a
 n intimate evening around the fireplace as Alan shares the stories behind 
 his driftwood and junk creations - whimsical birds\, imaginary creatures\,
  masks\, and abstract forms shaped by wind\, water\, and time. Each piece 
 begins with something discovered along Northern California beaches\, at fl
 ea markets\, or along the railroad tracks that run through town. The mater
 ial is shaped and sanded - sometimes burned\, sometimes painted or oiled -
  with found objects added to complete the story. Some pieces are elegant\;
  others are whimsical\, all feeling both playful and deeply connected to t
 he natural world.\n\nAlan has spent more than four decades designing homes
 \, wineries\, and community spaces across Sonoma County - and it’s fair 
 to say that few Healdsburg residents have had a greater hand in shaping ho
 w our city looks today. Alongside his architectural work\, he has develope
 d a unique artistic practice that blends craftsmanship\, curiosity\, and a
  deep appreciation for natural materials.\n\nDuring the evening\, Alan wil
 l share how he discovers the materials for his sculptures\, how each piece
  comes together\, and how architecture and art intersect in his creative l
 ife. Guests will also have the opportunity to view several of his works up
  close\, enjoy a glass of wine from a local favorite\, fantastic hors d’
 oeuvres from another local favorite\, learn more about the city they live 
 in\, and meet the people who leave a mark on this place.
LOCATION:Craftwork Healdsburg
URL:https://crafted-conversations-alan-cohen.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
