 terial is shaped and sanded - sometimes burned\, sometimes painted or oile
 d - with found objects added to complete the story. Some pieces are elegan
 t\; others are whimsical\, all feeling both playful and deeply connected t
 o the natural world.\n\nAlan has spent more than four decades designing ho
 mes\, wineries\, and community spaces across Sonoma County - and it’s fa
 ir to say that few Healdsburg residents have had a greater hand in shaping
