BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Honoring Mothers Sound Healing Journey
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260506T200000
UID:260311ClRiw7io20ClU63l-pfEyQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Heather Starr and Chris Young-Ginzburg for a special Moth
 er’s Day Sound Healing at the Energy Wave Center — an evening devoted 
 to honoring and celebrating Mothers.\n\nThis gathering is an invitation fo
 r Mothers to receive… to soften… to rest in the very care they so natu
 rally give to others. Through immersive sound healing\, songs to honor the
  Mother\, and the supportive energy of the scalar field space\, we will cr
 eate a sanctuary of nourishment\, gratitude\, and deep restoration. Come b
 e held. Come be replenished. Come be celebrated.\n\nExperience the Energy 
 Enhancement System™ \\(EESystem\\) as you rest in this supportive scalar
  field. Many experience profound relaxation\, cellular rejuvenation\, and 
 a gentle resetting of the body’s natural balance—amplifying the effect
 s of sound healing and creating an ideal foundation for welcoming the New 
 Year with vitality\, clarity\, and grace.\n\nSpace is limited to 14 partic
 ipants to preserve the intimacy and sacredness of the circle. \n\nAbout Y
 our Guides\n\nChris Young-Ginzburg\, of Grove Circle Healing\, is a season
 ed clairvoyant and sound healer with nearly two decades of experience in S
 onoma County. Chris weaves crystal singing bowls\, tuning forks\, and intu
 itive insight into transformative sound journeys that harmonize mind\, bod
 y\, and spirit. Their compassionate presence and depth of perception have 
 guided countless people through profound healing and self-discovery. Heath
 er Star is a Cosmic Co-Creatress devoted to weaving commUNITY through sac
 red song and healing events. Trained in Mind-Body Medicine\, she has facil
 itated hundreds of group healing circles\, guiding participants into embod
 ied awareness and soulful integration. Heather’s voice was powerfully ac
 tivated through Chris Young-Ginzburg’s Sound & Voice Activation work\, a
 nd together they now offer deeply attuned sound journeys that open hearts 
 and awaken inner wisdom. Seraflame | Healing Harmonic Collaboration Chris
  Young-Ginzburg and Heather Star are also core members of Seraflame\, a he
 aling harmonic collaboration devoted to anchoring light through sacred son
 g and frequency. Together\, they create channeled soundscapes designed to 
 support emotional healing\, energetic coherence\, and planetary awakening.
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center
URL:https://energywavecenter.com/chris-and-heather/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
