UID:260422AXALgUYuzEmQwj6pDjXItQ
DESCRIPTION:Intellectual Wellness featuring Alison Levine\n\nExpand your h
 orizons with world-renowned adventurer Alison Levine. Having survived sub-
 zero temperatures\, Mount Everest avalanches\, and a high-stakes career on
  Wall Street\, Alison is a preeminent expert on leadership in extreme envi
 ronments. Intellectual wellness is about the mindset required to navigate 
 life’s steepest climbs. Prepare to be inspired by her stories of grit an
 d grace\, paired with a conversation designed to sharpen your mind and spi
 rit for the "business" of life.
LOCATION:Eleven Eleven Wines
