BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Longboard Vineyards Wine\, Dine & Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T190000
UID:251224UOlwFuMzbkOt3DsWaQ4E2g
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing Junk in the Trunk & Adobos n’ More\n\nJoin us for a fun\, high-en
 ergy Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in d
 owntown Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold\
 , comforting cuisine. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the lively sound
 s of Junk in the Trunk with delicious Filipino dishes from Adobos n’ Mor
 e.\n\nJunk in the Trunk brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorites and dan
 ceable tunes\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a relaxed and social ev
 ening surrounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s 
 wines by the glass or bottle while Adobos n’ More serves classic Filipin
 o comfort food\, known for rich\, savory flavors and home-style cooking.\n
 \nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-
 21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welc
 ome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonom
 a County night of great music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine avail
 able for purchase Live music by Junk in the Trunk Food by Adobos n’ More
  \\(Filipino cuisine\\) Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel Room Address:
  5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
