SUMMARY:Friday Night Comedy - TammyTeaLove - Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T220000
UID:260404QgpdaIF7UUOfK-m7FUG5WQ
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of drinks (or a
  bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedians f
 rom The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick around a
 fter for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThis We
 ek: Jon Lehre (host) Paulie Escobedo Mean Dave\n\nHeadliner: Tammy Tea Lov
 e\n\nTammy E. Clarke (TammyTeaLove) is a comedian who was “Born in Brook
 lyn\, raised in Los Angeles and Got her Game from The Bay” now resides i
 n Oakland\, Her first break was on the spot with “Academy Award winning 
 Actress” Mo’Nique at the San Jose Improv. She first stepped on stage i
 n 2007 when her comedian friends pushed her on stage and said she should b
 e a comedian.\n\nTammyTeaLove has been Awarded the NW Black comedy fest. 
 “Funniest Comedian Award” TammyTeaLove has performed at clubs such as 
 Cobbs Comedy Club\, Punchline SF & SAC\, Comedy Château\, The Comedy Stor
 e Hollywood\, Sketchfest Sf 2019 & 2023 The Black Women In Comedy festival
  2021-22 and many others\, also Tammy is A two time Comedy Oakland “Cham
 pion.” on most nights and weekends Tammy is found on stage\, Telling rea
 l life stories that everyone can relate too!\n\nVisit **www.tammytea.com*
 *\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door Check out **www.BarrelPr
 oofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-night-comedy-tammytealove-downtown
 -santa-rosa-tickets-1984347427573?aff=oddtdtcreator
