BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cabaret\, the musical
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T210000
UID:260319Voe06JEGB06SSgyFXGcJxQ
DESCRIPTION:Willkommen\, Bienvenue\, Welcome to *Cabaret*! It’s 1930 Be
 rlin\, and inside the Kit Kat Klub the delirious party rages on\, even as 
 forces on the outside gather strength. But what c**a**n Sally\, Cliff\, Ko
 st\, Ludwig and the Emcee do about that? Come…Join Roustabout Theater’
 s Apprentice Program in our home in the Carston Cabaret as we dive into th
 is carefree atmosphere with Kander and Ebb’s iconic score – including 
 “Maybe This Time”\, “Mein Herr”\, “Two Ladies”\, “Don’t Te
 ll Mama”\, “Cabaret” – and\, for the first time\, featuring two ac
 tors from Roustabout’s Professional Ensemble: Bill Davis as Herr Schultz
  and and Loretta Janka as Fraulein Schneider. This is a party you won’t 
 soon forget. Leave your troubles outside and…Welcome!
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/roustabout-cabaret26/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
