 round you\, this paint session is all about expression\, conversation\, an
 d good energy. \n\nPresented by **Emerald Sky and Papa’s Herb**\, this 
 experience is your invitation to slow down\, light up\, and turn elevated 
 moments into art—Mercy style.\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, M
 ay 10\, 2026\n\n**Time:** 11:00 am - 2:00 pm\n\n**What’s Included**\n\nA
 ll painting supplies\n\nChill\, guided creative session — zero pressure\
 , all fun and you get to take home your masterpiece\n\nAn atmosphere buzzi
 ng with smooth evening beats\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark your c
 reativity\n\n**Ticket Tiers**\n\n**General Admission - $35:** Paint Suppli
 es Only\n\n**VIP Tier 1 - $50:** Includes a 🌱$25 Goodie Bag \n\n**VIP 
 Tier 2 - $75: Includes a 🌱$50 Goodie Bag** \n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-000
 0420-LIC
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://www.themercylounge.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
