BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Abstract Vision
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T110500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T170000
UID:260424CJucVDaW-EqJKSajJWnwFA
DESCRIPTION:Abstract art moves beyond representation\, with a strong empha
 sis on shape\, color and form. Abstract art has the power to evoke emotion
 s\, appeal to our senses and transcend the physical world. Abstract expres
 sion captures the delicate\, elusive\, powerful and radiant energies that 
 fly under the radar of explanation.\n\nExhibition Artists: Dahlo (Marcela 
 Cabrera)\, Tess Abts\, Erika Adkins\, Bev Barnett\, Tara Belkin Harvey\, C
 ynthia Brodie\, Deborah Chaney\, Sharon Crary\, Alyson Dobbert\, Dianne Je
 an Erickson\, Kristine Goldenberg\, Beth Hall\, Sarah Harvey\, Ann Kalb-Ki
 p\, Debra Kreck­Harnish\, Michelle Nishikatsu\, Katy Parks Wilson\, D. Mi
 mi Read\, Elizabeth Springs\, Carol Tacconi\, Deborah Titus\, Chris Vetran
 o\, Mike Wasden\, Kim Winter\, Tara Yellen\, Kay Young\, Sabina Zildzic
LOCATION:Healdsburg Center for the Arts
URL:https://healdsburgcenterforthearts.org/an-abstract-vision/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mother's Day Sparkling High Tea at The Meritage Resort and Spa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T140000
UID:260422p8Pyj8iV2k6NFgykjib68A
DESCRIPTION:An afternoon of sparkling elegance awaits at Sora Napa this Mo
 ther’s Day. Step into our signature rose-hued tasting room for a refined
  gathering designed to honor the women who inspire us most. Enjoy a curate
 d flight of Chandon sparkling wines paired with artfully crafted tea sandw
 iches\, savory bites\, and delicate desserts.\n\nUnhurried and intimate\, 
 the setting invites connection and conversation in a space that feels both
  elevated and welcoming. With limited seating available\, guests are invit
 ed to gather\, celebrate\, and toast to Mom in sophisticated Napa Valley s
 tyle.\n\nWith up to 25% off select weekend stays through the Memories in t
 he Making offer\, you have time to enjoy the Brunch\, Sparkling High Tea\,
  and Candle Making Classes. It’s the kind of Mother’s Day mama won’t
  stop talking about – until it becomes a tradition. Bonus: Flying Southw
 est? Their “Sip & Ship” perk lets you check a case of Napa wine for fr
 ee\, because one bottle was never the plan.
LOCATION:The Meritage Resort and Spa
URL:https://www.meritageresort.com/experience/event-calendar/sparkling-hig
 h-tea-mothers-day/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Powerhouse Ladies
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T213000
UID:260422azX1Zw8_wEmzNAumxUgYhQ
DESCRIPTION:Three amazing female vocalists will present Powerhouse Ladies\
 , at the California Theatre in Santa Rosa.\n\nOn May 10\, for a special Mo
 ther’s Day concert\, three amazing female vocalists will present Powerho
 use Ladies\, at the California Theatre in Santa Rosa. The concert will be 
 performed in the round - the singers will take turns trading off songs\, a
 ll while on stage together.\n\nEach singer brings something unique and pac
 ks a punch. This edition features Rebecca Roudman of Dirty Cello\, Ruby Le
 e Hill\, and Zoe Fitzgerald Carter. From Dirty Cello’s high-energy blend
  of blues\, rock\, and Americana\, to Ruby Lee Hill’s genre-spanning ori
 ginals and magnetic stage presence\, to Zoe Fitzgerald Carter’s award-wi
 nning songwriting and soulful storytelling\, each artist brings a distinct
  voice to the stage.  Variety\, depth and the unfettered female voice are
  the name of the game for one night only.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.caltheatre.com/event-details/powerhouse-ladies-3rd-edition
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mother's Day Brunch at The Meritage Resort and Spa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T160000
UID:260422A4IF-ufkI02ziyAEKfFkzA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day in the heart of Napa Valley with a la
 vish brunch buffet at The Meritage Resort and Spa\, where every detail is 
 designed to be savored. From made-to-order egg specialties and elegant cha
 rcuterie to chilled seafood\, carving stations\, and chef-driven entrées\
 , each offering reflects the richness of the season and the spirit of gath
 ering in Wine Country.\n\nEnjoy live music and as you explore artisan vend
 ors\, capture the moment at a festive photo booth\, and take part in lawn 
 games\, face painting\, and special raffles. A stop at the Spa Terra aroma
 therapy cart offers a thoughtful\, restorative touch to the celebration.\n
 \nWhether you’re raising a glass in her honor or enjoying time well spen
 t together\, Mother’s Day at The Meritage is an invitation to connect\, 
 indulge\, and create a tradition that lingers long after the last bite.\n\
 nFor an added touch of relaxation\, extend the celebration by booking a re
 juvenating treatment at Spa Terra.\n\nWith up to 25% off select weekend st
 ays through the Memories in the Making offer\, you have time to enjoy the 
 Brunch\, Sparkling High Tea\, and Candle Making Classes. It’s the kind o
 f Mother’s Day mama won’t stop talking about – until it becomes a tr
 adition. Bonus: Flying Southwest? Their “Sip & Ship” perk lets you che
 ck a case of Napa wine for free\, because one bottle was never the plan.
LOCATION:The Meritage Resort and Spa
URL:https://www.meritageresort.com/experience/event-calendar/mothers-day-b
 runch-2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
