SUMMARY:Gill Brothers Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T000000
UID:260224WnaFWww3zk2wwthNH1XxFQ
DESCRIPTION:Gill Brothers Band offers a heartfelt synthesis and interpreta
 tion of American country\, rock\, and blues stylings. Brothers Jacob and C
 onnor Gill share lead vocal and guitar duties to create a dialectically de
 licious plate of melody\, groove\, and storytelling. Drawing influence fro
 m the likes of Neil Young\, The Drive-By Truckers\, and James McMurtry\, G
 ill Brothers Band's music strikes at the hard-rocking side of country\, pl
