DESCRIPTION:Join Michelle at the Larson Family Winery for a Mother's Day B
 runch event! It's fun for the entire family and of course mom! Beautiful c
 ountry winery in the Sonoma Valley. More info available here: https://lars
 onfamilywinery.com/upcoming-events/\n\nBay Area breakout artist Michelle L
 ambert delivers a fun\, high-energy show filled with edgy\, heartfelt orig
 inal music\, infectious pop hooks\, and unstoppable charisma. Fresh off a 
 successful 40-date tour across the Western states last year\, Michelle cap
 tivates audiences with soaring vocals\, dynamic violin solos\, and vibrant
  energy that radiates through the crowd. Her electrifying performances cre
 ate an unforgettable live experience that will have you dancing\, smiling\
 , and celebrating all night long.\n\nRaised in Northern California and tra
 ined at the prestigious Berklee College of Music\, Michelle Lambert has fo
 rged her own path as a fearless\, independent pop artist. She has topped t
 he charts of Indie Radio with her original songs and was featured in the S
 an Francisco Giants’ City Connect Campaign as a notable Bay Area artist.
  Michelle cut her teeth performing and writing in the competitive music sc
 enes of Nashville and Los Angeles before returning to the Bay Area to tour
  with her own thriving career. Known for her powerful vocals\, masterful v
 iolin playing\, and bold\, colorful costumes\, Michelle pairs striking vis
 uals with raw emotional storytelling—embodying creativity\, resilience\,
  and the adventure of chasing your dreams. For more info on Michelle visit
 : https://www.michellelambert.com
LOCATION:Larson Family Winery
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108145732?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
