BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Multimedia Concert and Art Show in Napa — Mother's Day\, May 10
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T170000
UID:260428SSBGVikMrE63d3ty7x32ng
DESCRIPTION:**Experience the Intersection of Art\, Faith and Music featuri
 ng renowned artist He Qi and composer Allan Robert Petker**\n\nInternation
 ally acclaimed artist He Qi joins composer Allan Robert Petker for a multi
 media art-and-music experience in Napa on Mother's Day\, May 10. Petker wi
 ll conduct *Touch*\, his composition inspired by He Qi’s art\, performed
  by the Napa Methodist Cathedral Choir with orchestra. He Qi’s art will 
 be projected onscreen to create an immersive\, multisensory program. A pos
 t-concert reception and art exhibition will follow\, with He Qi exhibiting
  original works and prints available for purchase.\n\nHe Qi’s bold use o
 f color\, embellished forms\, and expressive brushwork blend Chinese folk 
 art with Western influences spanning the Middle Ages to modernism. His wor
 k has been described as “Chagall meets Matisse meets Picasso meets the E
 ast.” Allan Petker is a composer and arranger with more than 250 publish
 ed musical works.\n\n*A memorable Mother’s Day gift idea: inspiring musi
 c\, art\, and a reception all in one afternoon.*
LOCATION:Napa Methodist Church
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/multimedia-concert-and-
 art-show-in-napa-mother-s-day-may-10/18742970/2026-05-10T15
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
