DESCRIPTION:**May is Bike to Wherever Month!**\n\nRide your bike in May an
 d help us celebrate bicycling as a sustainable\, practical and fun way to 
 get around Sonoma County. Thousands of folks throughout the Bay Area will 
 participate in a host of cycling activities\, events and challenges throug
 hout the month of May. Get outside\, save money\, have fun\, and maybe eve
 n win some prizes!\n\nDuring the morning commute on **Bike to Work Day\, T
 hursday\, May 14**\, Energizer Stations throughout the County will dispens
 e snacks\, swag\, and support. Check our website for a list of Stations as
  well as other events throughout the month.
LOCATION:County-wide
URL:https://www.bikesonoma.org/our-work/btwd-3/
