DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday\, May 15\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Show 8 PM
 \n\nLocation: Coyote Sonoma\, 44F Mill Street\, Healdsburg\n\nFood Vendor
 : TBA\n\nTickets: $10 | Free for Coyote Sonoma Club Members\n\nGet out t
 he flannels and dust off your Docs! Midlife Riot is a San Rafael\, Califor
 nia based 4-piece bringing you all the anthems of 90s alternative rock. Fe
 aturing seasoned musicians from the Bay Area scene\, the band delivers a h
 igh-energy show packed with the hits that defined a generation. We play Gr
