DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T140000
UID:260425cEPbuZTZTUeBIKFxvoJIZw
DESCRIPTION:Join award-winning cartoonist **Brian Fies** to celebrate th
 e 20th anniversary of his groundbreaking graphic memoir\, *Mom’s Cancer
 *. Winner of the first-ever Eisner Award for Best Digital Comic\, *Mom’
 s Cancer* was the reason the category was created. It has been hailed as 
 one of the 10 most important Eisner Award winners of all time by *Comic B
 ook Resources (CBR)*. Fies will talk about his work at 2:00 pm\, followed
  by a book signing.
LOCATION:Charles M. Schulz Museum
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/graphic-medicine-moms-cancer/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
