DESCRIPTION:Mary Jane Mafia plays Green Day songs and punk all night! No c
 over! AND IT'S CASEY WILLIAMS' 50TH BIRTHDAY! Saturday night in Downtown S
 anta Rosa!\n\nGreen Day tribute\, MARY JANE MAFIA is in the house on Satur
 day Night\n\nIt's gonna be an all night party at Barrel Proof Lounge cause
  it's Casey Williams' 50th birthday party and he's opened the door to get 
 your punk on with Mary Jane Mafia playing Casey's favorite band\, Green Da
 y! You don't wanna miss a great rocking' night in downtown Santa Rosa. Com
 e by and wish Casey a Happy 50th Birthday!\n\n Live Music starts at 8PM 
  Punk rock and Green Day covers all night long  No Cover!  Free Popcorn
 ! 21+\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good t
 imes ahead!
