 e $297\, and VIP Frontier tables for eight are $2\,500. \n\nSip rare rese
 rve labels poured by the vintners\, premium wines and signature cocktails\
 , live music\, and a ranch-style BBQ dinner. Proceeds benefit the Sonoma V
 alley Vintners & Growers Foundation.\n\nAdditionally\, guests can add spor
