BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea and Tarot: Element of Air Alchemy of Thought
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T143000
UID:260428f_DeD-pjEECvuK7_xSIm4Q
DESCRIPTION: Air: Mental Alchemy Shadow Work\n\nTea &amp\; Tarot &bull\; T
 he Alchemy of Thought\n\nSunday\, May 17\n\nAir is the realm of the mind &
 mdash\; language\, memory\, belief\, perception\, and meaning. It shapes h
 ow we interpret reality and how reality responds to us. In this Air-themed
  Tea &amp\; Tarot gathering\, we enter the subtle territory of mental shad
 ow work: the unconscious thought forms\, internalized voices\, and belief 
 systems that quietly influence our choices\, communication\, and sense of 
 self.\n\nMental shadow is not simply &ldquo\;negative thinking.&rdquo\; It
  includes inherited narratives\, protective strategies of the psyche\, int
 ernalized authority\, and unexamined assumptions that once served a purpos
 e but now restrict growth. Through tarot\, we gently bring these patterns 
 into conscious awareness\, where they can be met with discernment rather t
 han suppression.\n\nThis is not a therapeutic intervention\, nor is it pre
 dictive. It is a sacred inquiry into how the mind constructs meaning &mdas
 h\; and how awareness restores agency.\n\nWhat We'll Explore\n\n    &bull\
 ;    The origins of recurring thought loops and mental habits\n\n    &bull
 \;    Internalized voices from family\, culture\, or past experiences\n\n 
    &bull\;    How fear\, control\, or avoidance shape perception\n\n    &b
 ull\;    Where clarity\, truth\, or expression is being unconsciously rest
 rained\n\n    &bull\;    The difference between intuition\, thought\, and 
 conditioned belief\n\nAir teaches us that thought is creative &mdash\; but
  not all thoughts are true. When we learn to listen beneath the noise of t
 he mind\, we reclaim authorship of our inner world and restore integrity t
 o our voice.
LOCATION:Magick Oak - Metaphysical Center & Enchanted Goods
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/tea-and-tarot-element-of-a
 ir-alchemy-of-thought?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
