 f salsa\, blended with elements of soul\, rock and jazz.   Her New album "
 Havana Rocks" recorded a few months ago\, in Cuba with the top musicians o
 f La Habana and Oriente\, as well as the great leader of the group SINTESI
 S\, Carlos Alfonso\, as Co-Producer\, and in Topanga\, CA\, with some of t
 he great musicians of her legendary band\, THE WILD CLAMS\, will be releas
 ed THIS SEPTEMBER 9\, WORLDWIDE...! Cecilia Noël & the Wild Clams.   The 
 Queen of Salsoul.
LOCATION:w/ Men At Work @ BottleRock Napa Valley 2026
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108180281?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
